      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003050050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ\r\nいーっぱい食べたから大丈夫！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300305/1003003050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それならいいんだけど──\r\nははっ、じっとしてられなかったんだな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003050060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ……うんっ\r\nお客さんたちの席、見てきたの！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300305/1003003050060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003050070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あのねっ\r\n今日はすーっごく色んな人がいるんだー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300305/1003003050070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ……うん、さすがショッピングモールだよなぁ！\r\n今日はチケットなくても観れるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003050080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だよねー！　家族で来てる人たちとか、\r\n部活帰りみたいな子たちもいたのっ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100300305/1003003050080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1003003050090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "お年寄りの人とか、カップルみたいな人たちとか\r\nこんな日もスーツ着てる人とか────",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
